6
00:01:58.000 --> 00:01:59.750
The battle of survival…

7
00:02:00.666 --> 00:02:02.041
asks for sacrifice.

8
00:02:04.166 --> 00:02:05.291
And there are…

9
00:02:06.291 --> 00:02:08.166
